@startuml
title LBSHelper Agent 处理时序图

actor 用户 as User
boundary "前端页面" as Frontend
control "LBSHelper Agent" as Agent
control "工作流启动器\nStartWorkflow" as Starter
control "地理任务识别/计划节点" as PlanNode
control "amap 工具节点" as AmapNode
control "AMap MCP 工具" as AmapTool
control "结果整理聊天模型节点" as SummaryNode

User -> Frontend : 提交地点/路线问题
activate Frontend

Frontend -> Agent : 发送用户输入
activate Agent

Agent -> Starter : 启动默认 LBS 工作流
activate Starter
Starter --> Agent : 返回工作流上下文
deactivate Starter

Agent -> PlanNode : 识别地理任务并生成地图服务调用计划
activate PlanNode
PlanNode --> Agent : 返回 tool_name 与 arguments 计划
deactivate PlanNode

loop 按计划执行地图子工具
    Agent -> AmapNode : 进入 amap 工具节点
    activate AmapNode
    AmapNode -> AmapTool : 根据 tool_name 执行地点检索/路线规划/周边查询
    activate AmapTool
    AmapTool --> AmapNode : 返回地图查询结果
    deactivate AmapTool
    AmapNode --> Agent : 返回单次调用结果
    deactivate AmapNode
end

Agent -> SummaryNode : 汇总多次调用结果并生成最终地点/路线结论
activate SummaryNode
SummaryNode --> Agent : 返回最终答案
deactivate SummaryNode

Agent --> Frontend : 返回结果
deactivate Agent

Frontend --> User : 展示地图服务结果
deactivate Frontend
@enduml